:"是否固定Y坐标，固定后父对象的Y方向位置将保持不变，默认关闭，不固定",en:"Defines whether to fix the Y coordinate of the object regardless of any kind of physical effect such as gravity, collision, etc.."},order:4354,groupName:"behavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"fixedRotation",locale:{zh:"固定旋转角度",en:"fixedRotate"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"是否固定旋转角度，固定后父对象的旋转角度将保持不变，默认关闭，不固定",en:"Defines whether to fix the Rotate angle of the object regardless of any kind of physical effect such as gravity, collision, etc.."},order:4355,groupName:"behavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"isCircle",locale:{zh:"圆形边界",en:"circularBoundary"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"是否启用圆形边界，启用后将以一个圆来简化代替父对象的碰撞边界，默认关闭，不开启",en:"Defines whether to use a circle as the collision boundary. The circle uses the Width of the component as its diameter. This property can also be set in Edit Collision Boundary alternatively."},order:4367,groupName:"collision",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"detectionDepth",locale:{zh:"碰撞判断层数",en:"collisionDepth"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"可用于判断碰撞的父对象层级数",en:"Sets the depth of the current object inside its moving parent when dictating its collision trigger. When an object moves with its parent objects and collides with another object, its Collision Depth needs to be no less than 1 such that its collision trigger can occur. Similarly, a value no less than 2 needs to be set for Collision Depth in the case that it moves with its grandparent. "},order:4368,groupName:"collision",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"autoDelete",locale:{zh:"自动删除",en:"autoDelete"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"当物体移动至物理世界边界之外时是否删除，针对克隆出来的对象，通常设为是，比如子弹，敌人等等，这样可以减少画布的运算性能消耗。",en:"Defines whether to delete the parent object automatically when it moves out of the Canvas range. This property is commonly set to True for the cloned objects, such as bullets, enemies in game scenario, in order to release device memory timely. "},order:4358,groupName:"behavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"mass",locale:{zh:"质量",en:"mass"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"物体在物理世界中的质量",en:"Sets the mass of the object in order to give physically correct behaviors."},order:4359,groupName:"value",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"globalVx",locale:{zh:"世界水平方向速度",en:"globalVx"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"世界水平方向速度",en:"globalVx"},order:4360,groupName:"motion",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"globalVy",locale:{zh:"世界垂直方向速度",en:"globalVy"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"世界垂直方向速度",en:"globalVy"},order:4361,groupName:"motion",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"velocityX",locale:{zh:"本层水平方向速度",en:"velocityX"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"本层水平方向速度",en:"velocityX"},order:4362,groupName:"motion",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"velocityY",locale:{zh:"本层垂直方向速度",en:"velocityY"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"本层垂直方向速度",en:"velocityY"},order:4363,groupName:"motion",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"angularVelocity",locale:{zh:"角速度",en:"angularVelocity"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"角速度即旋转速度",en:"angularVelocity"},order:4364,groupName:"motion",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"damping",locale:{zh:"阻尼",en:"damping"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"速度阻尼，阻尼越大，物体速度削减越快",en:"damping"},order:4365,groupName:"motion",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"angularDamping",locale:{zh:"角度阻尼",en:"angularDamping"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"角度旋转的阻尼，阻尼越大，角速度削减越快",en:"angularDamping"},order:4366,groupName:"motion",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"collisionResponse",locale:{zh:"碰撞反应",en:"allowCollide"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"是否启用碰撞反应，默认开启，若关闭，则不会与其他物体发生碰撞，其他物体会穿透本物体而过",en:"Defines whether to detect collision with other objects on the boundary of the object's parent. "},order:4356,groupName:"collision",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"drawClBoundary",locale:{zh:"编辑碰撞边界",en:"editCollisionBoundary"},type:"Button",desc:{zh:"绘制物体的碰撞编辑，默认为矩形编辑，通过点击将物体边界连接起来，也可以设置为圆形的点击边界",en:"Edits the range of the component within which the Collision related triggers are valid."},order:4357,groupName:"collision",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"ccdOpen",type:"Boolean",locale:{zh:"连续碰撞检测",en:"highSpeedCollide"},desc:{zh:"是否开启连续碰撞检测，开启之后，可以进一步设置检测的速度门槛以及检测频率。连续碰撞检测，可以防止物体高速运动的时候“穿墙”，因为物体高速运动时，普通的碰撞检测（默认的碰撞检测为离散碰撞检测）的频率会不够，导致物体和墙体接触时，没有检测到碰撞而“穿墙”。开启连续碰撞检测，会造成更大的画布性能开销，请酌情决定是否开启。",en:"Defines whether to detect collision of high speed. This is to avoid the 'through wall' effect when the parent object moves in high speed and fails to detect its collision with other objects.\nNote: turn on this property will require higher performance of device."},showDes:1,order:10491,groupName:"collision",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"ccdSpeedThreshold",type:"Number",locale:{zh:"连续碰撞检测速度门槛",en:"speedThreshold"},order:10492,groupName:"collision",desc:{zh:"默认为1000，只有当物体的运动速度大于这个速度门槛时，连续碰撞检测才会生效。这个值越大，开启连续碰撞检测的条件就苛刻，画布的性能开销也就越小。",en:"Sets the minimum speed of the parent object for the 'High Speed Collide' to be detected. (Only applicable when the 'High Speed Collide' is enabled.)\nNote: the lower the value, the higher performance of device is required."},showDes:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"ccdIterations",type:"Integer",locale:{zh:"连续碰撞检测频率",en:"detectFrequency"},order:10495,groupName:"collision",desc:{zh:"默认为10，越高越精密，开销越大。",en:"Sets the detect frequency. (Only applicable when the 'High Speed Collide' is enabled.)\nNote: the bigger the value, the higher performance of device is required."},showDes:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],group:"canvas-world",order:0},{name:"canvas-box",props:[{name:"id",type:"String",locale:{zh:"自定义ID",en:"customID"},desc:{zh:"当前组件的自定义ID，定义ID之后，可以在自定义函数里通过ids.xxx（xxx就是这个自定义id）来引用到这个对象，来对其进行进一步的处理。比如，设置属性等等。",en:"Sets Custom ID for the component such that the component can be called in Function as ids.xxx (xxx is the value of Custom ID). This is similar to the Custom Class property of some components."},showDes:1,order:10429,groupName:"behavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"x",locale:{en:"X",zh:"X"},type:"Integer",desc:{zh:"绝对定位环境下可设置，相对父容器的X坐标值。",en:"Indicates the X coordinate from its parent object.\nNote: Only applicable in Absolute Position Objects."},order:4369,groupName:"xy0",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"y",locale:{en:"Y",zh:"Y"},type:"Integer",desc:{zh:"绝对定位环境下可设置，相对父容器的Y坐标值。