rSpacing",zh:"字符间距"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"邻近两个字符之间的距离。",en:"Sets the space between letters. Unit in pixel."},order:4460,groupName:"textLayout",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"textAlign",locale:{en:"textAlign",zh:"水平对齐"},options:[{name:"left",en:"left",zh:"左对齐"},{name:"center",en:"center",zh:"居中"},{name:"right",en:"right",zh:"右对齐"}],type:"BtnSwitch",desc:{zh:"文本内容水平对齐的方式。",en:"Sets the texture horizontal alignment of the content."},order:4458,groupName:"textLayout",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],locale:{zh:"canvas-font",en:"canvas-font"},order:0},{name:"canvas-graphics",props:[{name:"fillColor",locale:{en:"backgroundColor",zh:"背景颜色"},type:"Color",desc:{zh:"当前对象的背景颜色。",en:"Sets the background color of the component.\nAlpha is the opacity of color.\nColor Names are supported by all browsers in HTML5.\nExample:\n#FF0000\nrgba(255,0,0,0.82)\nblack"},order:4461,groupName:"bg",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"lineColor",locale:{en:"borderColor",zh:"边框颜色"},type:"Color",desc:{zh:"对象边框的线条颜色。",en:"Sets the color of component's borders. Alpha is the opacity of color.\nColor Names are supported by all browsers in HTML5.\nExample:\n#FF0000\nrgba(255,0,0,0.82)\nblack"},order:4463,groupName:"border",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"lineWidth",locale:{en:"lineWidth",zh:"边框宽度"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"对象边框的宽度。",en:"Sets the thickness of component's borders."},order:4462,groupName:"border",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],extends:["canvas-box","canvas-overlap"],locale:{zh:"canvas-graphics",en:"canvas-graphics"},order:0},{name:"canvas-image",locale:{en:"Image",zh:"图片"},props:[{name:"link",locale:{en:"imageURL",zh:"素材资源地址"},type:"Upload",desc:{zh:"图片素材在服务器上的唯一存储地址。每上传一张图片，该地址将自动生成，也可通过设置属性或数据绑定动态更换图片素材。\n更换资源位置仅改变素材内容，不会改变对象本身的属性。",en:"\nSets the URL of the image. The URL is automatically generated when uploading an image file from local folder."},order:4465,groupName:"value",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"scaleMode",locale:{en:"fitMode",zh:"裁剪缩放模式"},options:[{name:"scaleToFill",en:"Fill",zh:"拉伸缩放",desc:{zh:"拉伸缩放指的是当图片尺寸与视口不一致时候，会对图片进行一定的拉伸缩放，保证图片始终能在视口内呈现全貌，这种模式下，可能会导致图片的内容被压扁或拉长，影响原本的图像比例。",en:"Stretch or squish the image until it fills its frame. The original aspect ratio might change."}},{name:"aspectFit",en:"Fit Long Side",zh:"等比缩放(长边为准)",desc:{zh:"等比缩放指的是以某一边为准，在视口内等比例的放大或者缩小图片，这种模式下会保持图片内容的原本比例，以长边为准，会将长边缩放至视口对应边长，这可能会导致图片在视口短边对应方向的两侧空白。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit its long side with the frame and centralize its short side. The short side, after scaled, will be cut if exceeding the frame, or be complemented with blank if undersize."}},{name:"aspectFill",en:"Fit Short Side",zh:"等比缩放(短边为准)",desc:{zh:"等比缩放指的是以某一边为准，在视口内等比例的放大或者缩小图片，这种模式下会保持图片内容的原本比例，以短边为准，会将短边缩放至视口对应边长，可能会导致长边方向部分图片内容被裁切。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit its short side with the frame and centralize its long side. The long side, after scaled, will be cut if exceeding the frame, or be complemented with blank if undersize."}},{name:"widthFix",en:"Fit Width",zh:"宽度固定,高度自动",desc:{zh:"固定边长提供高度和宽度两种，也就是以设置的宽度或者高度为准。将图片等比放缩到设置的宽度或者高度，这种模式下同样可以保持图片内容的原本比例，或者部分图片内容被裁切。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit the Width, and ignore the Height."}},{name:"heightFix",en:"Fit Height",zh:"高度固定,宽度自动",desc:{zh:"固定边长提供高度和宽度两种，也就是以设置的宽度或者高度为准。将图片等比放缩到设置的宽度或者高度，这种模式下同样可以保持图片内容的原本比例，或者部分图片内容被裁切。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit the Height, and ignore the Width."}},{name:"top",en:"Top Center",zh:"只显示顶部区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示顶部区域时，图片的上边的中点，会与视口的上中点重合。",en:"Crop the top center part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"bottom",en:"Bottom Center",zh:"只显示底部区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示底部区域时，图片的下边的中点，会与视口的下中点重合。",en:"Crop the bottom center part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"left",en:"Left Center",zh:"只显示左边区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示左边区域时，图片的左边的中点，会与视口的左中点重合。",en:"Crop the left center part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"right",en:"Right Center",zh:"只显示右边区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示右边区域时，图片的右边的中点，会与视口的右中点重合。",en:"Crop the right ce