iginal' based on component type."},order:5245,groupName:"wh0",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"maxWidth",locale:{en:"maxWidth",zh:"最大宽度"},type:"PercentPxInt",desc:{zh:"当前组件参与相对布局时随窗口自动调整宽度的最大值，可设定为固定像素或比例。",en:"Sets the maximum width of the component.\nIf the content is larger than the maximum width, it will automatically change the height of the element.\nNote: Only valid when you clear Width in Relative Position Objects."},order:5243,groupName:"sizeRange",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"minWidth",locale:{en:"minWidth",zh:"最小宽度"},type:"PercentPxInt",desc:{zh:"当前组件参与相对布局时随窗口自动调整宽度的最小值，可设定为固定像素或比例。",en:"Sets the minimum width of the component.\nIf the content is smaller than the minimum width, the minimum width will be applied.\nNote: Only valid when you clear Width in Relative Position Objects."},order:5244,groupName:"sizeRange",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"height",locale:{en:"h",zh:"高"},type:"PercentPxInt",desc:{zh:"当前组件的高度，在绝对定位的环境下只接受具体像素值；相对定位环境下则可以使用具体像素值或相对于父级元素高的百分比来进行定义。",en:"Sets the height of the component. \nThe height of the object in pixels or percentage of its parent object's height, by using 'px' or '%' after the numeric input to differentiate the unit.\nNote: '%' can only be used in Relative Position Objects. When Height is empty, it will be 'auto', 'auto wrap', or 'original' based on component type."},order:5249,groupName:"wh0",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"maxHeight",locale:{en:"maxHeight",zh:"最大高度"},type:"PercentPxInt",desc:{zh:"当前组件参与相对布局时随窗口自动调整高度的最大值，可设定为固定像素或比例。",en:"Sets the maximum height of the component.\nIf the content is larger than the maximum height, it will overflow.\nNote: Only valid when you clear Height in Relative Position Objects."},order:5246,groupName:"sizeRange",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"minHeight",locale:{en:"minHeight",zh:"最小高度"},type:"PercentPxInt",desc:{zh:"当前组件参与相对布局时随窗口自动调整高度的最小值，可设定为固定像素或比例。",en:"Sets the minimum height of the component.\nIf the content is smaller than the minimum height, the minimum height will be applied\nNote: Only valid when you clear Height in Relative Position Objects."},order:5247,groupName:"sizeRange",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"visible",locale:{en:"visible",zh:"可见"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"当前组件是否在前端可见，通过开关切换，默认为可见。如果该组件处于相对定位容器中，当组件不可见时，其不参与布局中的占位。",en:"Defines whether the component is rendered as UI on the page. It can be used to control the visibility of the component. \nNote: The position of sibling objects will be affected if the current object is in Relative Position Environment."},order:5248,groupName:"visible0",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"opacity",locale:{en:"opacity",zh:"不透明度"},type:"Percentage",desc:{zh:"当前组件的不透明度，默认为1（100%），即完全可视。可用滑块或调整数值进行调节。值越小组件越透明，为零时即完全不可见。\n在事件面板设置属性或做数据绑定时，请填写0 -1之间的小数。1代表100%。",en:"Sets the opacity of the component using a percentage value."},order:18246,groupName:"opacity0",showDes:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"marginTop",locale:{en:"marginTop",zh:"外边距上"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件上边框与其上方元素之间的距离。",en:"Sets the top spacing outside the border of component."},order:5250,groupName:"margin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"marginBottom",locale:{en:"marginBottom",zh:"外边距下"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件下边框与其下方元素之间的距离。",en:"Sets the bottom spacing outside the border of component."},order:5251,groupName:"margin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"marginLeft",locale:{en:"marginLeft",zh:"外边距左"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件左边框与其左侧元素之间的距离。",en:"Sets the left spacing outside the border of component."},order:5252,groupName:"margin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"marginRight",locale:{en:"marginRight",zh:"外边距右"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件右边框与其右侧元素之间的距离。",en:"Sets the right spacing outside the border of component."},order:5253,groupName:"margin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"zIndex",locale:{en:"zIndex",zh:"堆叠次序"},type:"Integer",desc:{zh:"当前组件的堆叠顺序，即“z轴”上的叠放次序。堆叠次序是一个整数，可以为负。数值越高的组件，会相对同一个父节点的下的其他对象，叠放在更上面。在ivx中，绝对定位环境下，我们可以通过对象树中的顺序来设置对象的堆叠次序，但在相对定位环境中，由于对象默认是流式布局，在对象有重叠的情况下，我们可以通过堆叠次序来手动调整对象之间的重叠关系。",en:"Specifies the display stack order of the object among its siblings.\nA negative value sets the object invisible. An object with greater stack order is always in front of its siblings with lower stack order. Display order will obey the order of Object Tree if the stack orders are the same."},showDes:1,linkZH:"https://help.ivx.cn/?id=qa--8133669728",order:5254,groupName:"zIndex",linkEN:""},{name:"originX",locale:{en:"originX",zh:"X原点"},type:"Percentage",desc:{zh:"当前组件原点的X坐标位置，默认为0，即水平方向的最左端，设置为1则为组件的最右端。组件发生旋转时，原点是组件旋转的中心点。",en:"Defines the ratio of the offset of object's center rotation to its width. It's used to calculate the X coordinate for rotation.\nNote: In Absolute Position objects, translate(-{Origin-X} %) will also be triggered afterwards to move objects Horizontally"},order:5254,groupName:"rotation",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"originY",locale:{en:"originY",zh:"Y原点"},type:"Percentage",desc:{zh:"当前组件原点的Y坐标位置，默认为0，即竖直方向的最上端，设置为1则为组件的最下端。组件发生旋转时，原点是组件旋转的中心点。",en:"Defines the ratio of offset of object's center rotation to its Height. It's used to calculate Y coordinate for rotation.\nNote: In Absolute Position objects, translate(-{Origin-Y} %) will also be triggered afterwards to move objects vertically."},order:5255,groupName:"rotation",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"rotate",locale:{en:"rotate",zh:"旋转角度"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件的旋转角度，默认为0度，即不旋转，可设置范围为0°~360°。",en:"Sets the rotation angle of the component around its center of rotation (Origin-X, Origin-Y). \nNote:This is also known as Rotate-Z."},order:5256,groupName:"rotation",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"rotateX",type:"Number",locale:{zh:"X轴旋转",en:"rotateX"},desc:{zh:"当前组件围绕其水平轴以给定的度数进行旋转，旋转角度为90°时，组件会垂直于父元素而不可见。",en:"Sets the rotation angle of the component around its X axis."},order:5257,groupName:"dom3DRotation",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"rotateY",type:"Number",locale:{zh:"Y轴旋转",en:"rotateY"},desc:{zh:"当前组件围绕其竖直轴以给定的度数进行旋转，旋转角度为90°时，组件也会垂直于父元素而不可见。",en:"Sets the rotation angle of the component around its Y axis."},order:5269,groupName:"dom3DRotation",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"translateZ",type:"Integer",locale:{zh:"Z轴偏移",en:"translateZ"},order:5270,groupName:"dom3DRotation",desc:{zh:"设置组件在Z轴上的偏移量。",en:"Sets the offset of the object along the z-axis in 3D space, which results the object to be closer to or farther away from the viewer."},linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"borderRadius",locale:{en:"borderRadius",zh:"边框圆角"},type:"PercentPx",desc:{zh:"当前组件矩形边框的圆角对应的圆半径大小。（绑定数值或文本时需要加上单位px：变量+'px'）",en:"Sets the radius of the component's corners, by using '%' or 'px' after the numeric input to differentiate the unit.  \nNote: '%' is only valid when presetting value in the properties panel. Binding and setting value through Actions do not support '%' unit of this property."},order:5262,groupName:"border",showDes:1,const:0,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"borderRadiusPos",locale:{en:"borderRadiusPosition",zh:"圆角位置"},type:"SelectMore",desc:{zh:"当前组件矩形边框的圆角位置，默认四个圆角都为开启状态，可点击选择保留或去除某一角的圆角。当需要通过变量绑定控制显示时，需将其视为一个四位的二进制数，以位置左上、右上、右下、左下的顺序，依次对应第一二三四位，如点亮左上与右上，对应二进制数是0011，转为十进制后是3，因此绑定数值3可以实现只显示左上右上圆角的效果。",en:"Defines the component's corners to which the Border Radius property will be applied (multiple choice)."},order:5263,groupName:"border",showDes:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"borderWidth",locale:{en:"borderWidth",zh:"边框宽度"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件矩形边框的宽度。",en:"Sets the thickness of component's borders."},order:5258,groupName:"border",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"borderStyle",locale:{en:"borderStyle",zh:"边框类型"},type:"Select",options:[{name:"none",en:"none",zh:"无边框",desc:{zh:"无边框",en:""}},{name:"solid",en:"solid",zh:"实线",desc:{zh:"实线",en:""}},{name:"dashed",en:"dashed",zh:"虚线",desc:{zh:"虚线",en:""}},{name:"dotted",en:"dotted",zh:"点状边框",desc:{zh:"点状边框",en:""}}],desc:{zh:"当前组件矩形边框的线条类型，包含：实线（默认）、虚线、点状边框和无边框。",en:"Sets the style of component's borders."},order:5260,groupName:"border",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"borderColor",locale:{en:"borderColor",zh:"边框颜色"},type:"Color",desc:{zh:"当前组件矩形边框的颜色。",en:"Sets the color of component's borders. Alp