放，保证图片始终能在视口内呈现全貌，这种模式下，可能会导致图片的内容被压扁或拉长，影响原本的图像比例。",en:"Stretch or squish the image until it fills its frame. The original aspect ratio might change."}},{name:"aspectFit",en:"Fit Long Side",zh:"等比缩放(长边为准)",desc:{zh:"等比缩放指的是以某一边为准，在视口内等比例的放大或者缩小图片，这种模式下会保持图片内容的原本比例，以长边为准，会将长边缩放至视口对应边长，这可能会导致图片在视口短边对应方向的两侧空白。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit its long side with the frame and centralize its short side. The short side, after scaled, will be cut if exceeding the frame, or be complemented with blank if undersize."}},{name:"aspectFill",en:"Fit Short Side",zh:"等比缩放(短边为准)",desc:{zh:"等比缩放指的是以某一边为准，在视口内等比例的放大或者缩小图片，这种模式下会保持图片内容的原本比例，以短边为准，会将短边缩放至视口对应边长，可能会导致长边方向部分图片内容被裁切。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit its short side with the frame and centralize its long side. The long side, after scaled, will be cut if exceeding the frame, or be complemented with blank if undersize."}},{name:"widthFix",en:"Fit Width",zh:"宽度固定,高度自动",desc:{zh:"固定边长提供高度和宽度两种，也就是以设置的宽度或者高度为准。将图片等比放缩到设置的宽度或者高度，这种模式下同样可以保持图片内容的原本比例，或者部分图片内容被裁切。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit the Width, and ignore the Height."}},{name:"heightFix",en:"Fit Height",zh:"高度固定,宽度自动",desc:{zh:"固定边长提供高度和宽度两种，也就是以设置的宽度或者高度为准。将图片等比放缩到设置的宽度或者高度，这种模式下同样可以保持图片内容的原本比例，或者部分图片内容被裁切。",en:"Scale up/down the image to fit the Height, and ignore the Width."}},{name:"top",en:"Top Center",zh:"只显示顶部区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示顶部区域时，图片的上边的中点，会与视口的上中点重合。",en:"Crop the top center part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"bottom",en:"Bottom Center",zh:"只显示底部区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示底部区域时，图片的下边的中点，会与视口的下中点重合。",en:"Crop the bottom center part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"left",en:"Left Center",zh:"只显示左边区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示左边区域时，图片的左边的中点，会与视口的左中点重合。",en:"Crop the left center part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"right",en:"Right Center",zh:"只显示右边区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示右边区域时，图片的右边的中点，会与视口的右中点重合。",en:"Crop the right center part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"top left",en:"Top Left",zh:"只显示左上区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示左上区域时，图片的左上角，会与视口的左上角重合。",en:"Crop the top left part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"top right",en:"Top Right",zh:"只显示右上区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示右上区域时，图片的右上角，会与视口的右上角重合。",en:"Crop the top right part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"bottom left",en:"Bottom Left",zh:"只显示左下区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示左下区域时，图片的左下角，会与视口的左下角重合。",en:"Crop the bottom left part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}},{name:"bottom right",en:"Bottom Right",zh:"只显示右下区域",desc:{zh:"图片会以原本的分辨率尺寸呈现，只显示右下区域时，图片的右下角，会与视口的右下角重合。",en:"Crop the bottom right part of the image. Complement with blank if necessary."}}],desc:{zh:"顾名思义指的是对图片进行一定的拉伸，主要提供了四种模式，包括拉伸缩放、等比缩放、固定边长、只显示xx区域。（在具体说明中，我们将设置图片宽高形成的矩形称为图片的一个视口）",en:"Specifies how the image is resized to fit its frame. (The rectangle defined by Width and Height.)"},showDes:0,order:5677,groupName:"behavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"lazyLoad",locale:{en:"lazyLoad",zh:"图片懒加载"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"当图片尚未出现在可视区域的时候先不加载图片，等到图片进入可视区域时候再加载图片。防止页面上图片过多的时候，一次性对服务器发送大量请求，导致服务器响应慢，页面卡顿崩溃等。",en:"Defines whether to defer the loading of image until it needs to be rendered visible."},showDes:1,order:5678,groupName:"behavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"progressiveLoad",locale:{en:"progressiveLoad",zh:"模糊加载"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"打开模糊加载后，在网速不佳的情况下会先加载一张分辨率较低的图(128px*128px)，等待原图加载完成后再替换掉模糊的图。",en:"Defines whether the image will be preloaded as a low resolution thumbnail until the entire image is loaded."},showDes:1,order:5679,groupName:"behavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"enableSave",locale:{en:"longPressToSave",zh:"长按保存(微信中)"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"微信浏览器提供了图片长按保存的功能，打开这个开关，用户在微信浏览器中可以长按此图片，出现保存菜单。注意，这个功能是微信浏览器专门提供的功能，在其他浏览器中无效。",en:"Defines whether allow image saving through long press."},showDes:1,order:5682,groupName:"advancedBehavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"initialWidth",locale:{en:"initialWidth",zh:"模糊图宽"},type:"Integer",desc:{zh:"当打开模糊加载选项之后，我们可以设置初始加载的模糊图的宽高，默认为100px*100px。",en:"Sets the width of the thumbnail to preload. Only applicable when 'Progressive Load' property is enabled.\nThe thumbnail will be stretched to fill the Width and show a low resolution effect."},order:5680,groupName:"behavior",ctrlHide:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"initialHeight",locale:{en:"initialHeight",zh:"模糊图高"},type:"Integer",desc:{zh:"当打开模糊加载选项之后，我们可以设置初始加载的模糊图的宽高，默认为100px*100px。",en:"Sets the height of the thumbnail to preload. Only applicable when 'Progressive Load' property is enabled.\nThe thumbnail will be stretched to fill the Height and show a low resolution effect."},order:5681,groupName:"behavior",ctrlHide:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"paddingTop",locale:{en:"paddingTop",zh:"内边距上"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件上边框与其内部内容之间的距离。",en:"Sets the top spacing outside the component's content, inside the border of component."},order:5683,groupName:"padding",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"paddingBottom",locale:{en:"paddingBottom",zh:"内边距下"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件下边框与其内部内容之间的距离。",en:"Sets the bottom spacing outside the component's content, inside the border of component."},order:5684,groupName:"padding",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"paddingLeft",locale:{en:"paddingLeft",zh:"内边距左"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件左边框与其内部内容之间的距离。",en:"Sets the left spacing outside the component's content, inside the border of component."},order:5685,groupName:"padding",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"paddingRight",locale:{en:"paddingRight",zh:"内边距右"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"当前组件右边框与其内部内容之间的距离。",en:"Sets the right spacing outside the component's content, inside the border of component."},order:5686,groupName:"padding",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"useTranslate3d",type:"Boolean",locale:{zh:"3D变换",en:"use3DTransform"},desc:{zh:"默认打开，确保在ios中的动画流畅性，但针对某些容器外部容器的行为，比如圆角等等，可能会导致对象的层叠关系不停的闪烁，此时可以关闭这个开关来解决。",en:"By default, it is turned on to ensure smooth animation in iOS. However, for some external container behaviors such as rounded corners, the stacking relationship of objects may flicker continuously. In this case, you can turn off this switch to solve the problem"},showDes:1,order:10349,groupName:"advancedBehavior",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"rawSvg",type:"String",locale:{zh:"原始Svg",en:"rawSvg"},desc:{zh:'可填写原始svg代码作为图片资源地址。注意：部分依赖于img标签的功能，填了"原始Svg"属性会无法使用，如"长按保存"是用在img标签上的。\n方式是插入的svg，需注意svg自身的样式如def标签id不能重复，避免svg的样式覆盖（def标签id重复当两张svg同时使用会造成样式覆盖）',en:'The original SVG code can be filled in as the image resource address. Note: Some functions that depend on the img tag cannot be used if the "Original Svg" property is filled in, such as "Long press to save", which is used on the img tag.\nThe method is to insert the SVG. Note that the style of the SVG itself, such as the def tag id, must not be repeated to avoid the SVG style from being overwritten (if the def tag id is repeated, the style will be overwritten when two SVGs are used at the same time).'},order:17251,showDes:1,ctrlHide:1,groupName:"value",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],methods:[{name:"setSrc",locale:{en:"setUrl",zh:"设置图片资源"},params:[{name:"src",locale:{en:"url",zh:"资源地址"},type:"Formula",desc:{zh:"可以是ivx中上传的某个图片资源地址（比如另一个图片.素材资源地址属性），一个完整的外部图片URL地址（需带上https头），或一个base64地址（比如打印画布的返回结果）。",en:"The URL of the image."}}],desc:{zh:"重新设定图片的资源地址，仅替换图片素材不改变对象属性。资源地址可以是ivx中上传的某个图片资源地址（比如另一个图片.素材资源地址属性），一个完整的外部图片URL地址（需带上https头），或一个base64地址（比如打印画布的返回结果）。",en:"Sets the URL of the image."},callback:{},order:5688,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"toDataURL",locale:{en:"toBase64",zh:"转Base64"},callback:{result:{en:"base64Code",zh:"Base64编码"},status:[{name:"finished",en:"completed",zh:"完成"}]},desc:{zh:"将图片转为Base64编码格式。",en:"Converts the image to base64 code."},order:5689,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"_currentWidth",locale:{zh:"获取原始素材宽|素材宽",en:"originalWidth"},desc:{zh:"获取图片素材的原始宽度，其和图片组件在页面上显示的宽度可能不同，后者由图片组件的宽度属性决定。",en:"The original width of the component. This value is provided as the component's property when referred in the formula editor of the action box."},order:8978,showDes:1,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"_currentHeight",locale:{zh:"获取原始素材高|素材高",en:"originalHeight"},desc:{zh:"获取图片素材的原始高度，其和图片组件在页面上显示的高度可能不同，后者由图片组件的高度属性决定。\n在动作中可以调用到的属性值，为图片的原始宽度值。\n在动作中可以调用到的属性值，为图片的原始高度值。",en:"The original height of the component. This value is provided as the component's property when referred in the formula editor of the action box."},order:8979,showDes:1,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],events:[{name:"mouseover",locale:{en:"mouseOver",zh:"鼠标移入"},params:[{name:"pageX",locale:{en:"pageX",zh:"X坐标"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"鼠标位置的X坐标",en:""}},{name:"pageY",locale:{en:"pageY",zh:"Y坐标"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"鼠标位置的Y坐标",en:""}}],desc:{zh:"鼠标指针从当前对象外部移入内部时触发。",en:"Occurs when the user finger/mouse pointer enters the boundary of the component, or enters its content or child objects."},order:5690,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"mouseout",locale:{en:"mouseOut",zh:"鼠标移出"},desc:{zh:"鼠标指针从当前对象内部移出至外部时触发。",en:"Occurs when the user finger/mouse pointer leaves the boundary of the component, or leaves its content or child objects."},order:5691,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"loadError",locale:{en:"loadError",zh:"图片加载失败"},desc:{zh:"图片资源加载失败时触发，可能因为URL失效或网络故障。",en:"Occurs when the image fails to load. "},order:5692,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"load",locale:{en:"load",zh:"图片加载成功"},desc:{zh:"图片加载成功后触发",en:"Occurs when the image loads successfully."},order:5693,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],extends:["ih5-base"],group:"basicUI",order:10},{name:"ih5-image-series",locale:{en:"Image Series",zh:"图片序列"},props:[{name:"width",locale:{en:"w",zh:"宽"},type:"PercentPxInt",desc:{zh:"当前组件的宽度，在绝对定位的环境下只接受具体像素值；相对定位环境下则可以使用具体像素值或相对于父级元素宽的百分比来进行定义。",en:"Sets the width of the component. \nThe width of the object in pixels or percentage of its parent object's width, by using 'px' or '%'