:"通过开关控制是否循环播放，默认开启，会循环播放",en:"Defines whether to play the Image Series in loop."},order:5709,groupName:"play",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"imageList",locale:{en:"imageList",zh:"图片列表"},type:"Array",desc:{zh:"图片序列中的所有图片，支持添加修改删除图片，以及设置每一张图片的播放时长占比，还可以预览图片序列的播放效果。",en:"Adds or deletes the images of Image Series.\nSub property: Weight (decimals)\nDescribes the weight of duration of each image in image series.\nThe concrete duration can be calculated by \nDuration * (Weight/total Weight)"},order:5711,groupName:"value",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"period",locale:{en:"duration",zh:"总时长 (ms)"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"图片序列完整播放一次的总时长。",en:"Specifies how many milliseconds the Image Series takes to play one cycle."},order:5707,groupName:"play",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],methods:[{name:"show",locale:{en:"show",zh:"显示"},desc:{zh:"组件从隐藏状态切换到显示状态。",en:"Shows the component and renders it as UI on the page. This is the same as setting Visible property to 'true'."},order:5713,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"hide",locale:{en:"hide",zh:"隐藏"},desc:{zh:"组件从显示状态切换到隐藏状态。",en:"Hides the component and does not render it as UI on the page. This is the same as setting Visible property to 'false'."},order:5714,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"toggleVisible",locale:{en:"toggleVisible",zh:"交替显示"},desc:{zh:"组件执行“显示—隐藏”的交替动作，当前如是显示状态，则变为隐藏；反之亦然。",en:"Shows or hides the component alternately."},order:5715,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"play",locale:{en:"play",zh:"播放"},desc:{zh:"播放图片序列",en:"Plays the Image Series."},order:5716,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"pause",locale:{en:"pause",zh:"暂停"},desc:{zh:"暂停图片序列",en:"Pauses the Image Series."},order:5717,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"reset",locale:{en:"reset",zh:"重置"},desc:{zh:"重置图片序列至第一张图片，但不播放",en:"Resets the Image Series to the first image, and stops playing if necessary. "},order:5718,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"playNextFrame",locale:{en:"nextImage",zh:"下一