resses the component for 0.35 seconds."},order:7168,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"touchstart",locale:{en:"touchStart",zh:"手指按下"},desc:{zh:"移动设备上，手指在当前组件范围内按下的瞬间触发。\n",en:"Occurs when the user presses down the finger or the mouse left key within the component. This includes all the triggers that involve pressing finger/mouse left key, such as Click, Double Click and Long Press, etc.."},order:7169,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"touchend",locale:{en:"touchEnd",zh:"手指离开"},desc:{zh:"移动设备上，手指在当前组件范围内松开的瞬间触发。",en:"Occurs when the user lifts up the finger or the mouse left key within the component. This includes all the triggers that involve lifting finger/mouse left key, such as Click, Double Click and Long Press, etc.."},order:7170,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"touchmove",locale:{en:"touchMove",zh:"滑动"},desc:{zh:"手指在当前组件范围内向任意方向滑动时触发。",en:"Occurs when the user presses and moves the finger/mouse across the component. It keeps triggering for each movement recognized by the system."},order:7171,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"swipeleft",locale:{en:"swipeLeft",zh:"左滑"},desc:{zh:"手指在组件范围内向左滑动时触发。",en:"Occurs when the user swipes the component in the left direction."},order:7172,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"swiperight",locale:{en:"swipeRight",zh:"右滑"},desc:{zh:"手指在组件范围内向右滑动时触发。",en:"Occurs when the user swipes the component in the right direction."},order:7173,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"swipeup",locale:{en:"swipeUp",zh:"上滑"},desc:{zh:"手指在组件范围内向上滑动时触发。\n",en:"Occurs when the user swipes the component in the up direction."},order:7174,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"swipedown",locale:{en:"swipeDown",zh:"下滑"},desc:{zh:"手指在组件范围内向下滑动时触发。",en:"Occurs when the user swipes the component in the down direction."},order:7175,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],locale:{zh:"iwx-base",en:"iwx-base"},order:0},{name:"iwx-baseAbs",props:[{name:"x",locale:{en:"X",zh: