Shadow",zh:"接受投影"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"是否接受投影，通过开关切换，默认关闭。",en:"Defines whether an object under 3D will accept the shadows of other objects to be projected onto its surface."},order:8620,groupName:"material",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"material",locale:{en:"material",zh:"材质"},type:"Select",options:[{name:"0",en:"Mesh Basic",zh:"不反光",desc:{zh:"",en:"A material not affected by lights."}},{name:"1",en:"Mesh Lambert",zh:"亚光",desc:{zh:"",en:"A material for non-shiny surfaces with matte effect."}},{name:"2",en:"Mesh Phong",zh:"高光",desc:{zh:"",en:"A material for shiny surfaces with specular highlights."}},{name:"3",en:"Mesh Standard",zh:"金属光泽",desc:{zh:"",en:"A standard physically based material, using Metallic-Roughness workflow."}}],desc:{zh:"设置当前物体的材质。",en:"Sets the material for the component to achieve different specular effect."},order:8612,groupName:"material",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"roughness",type:"Percentage",order:11985,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:"",locale:{zh:"roughness",en:"roughness"}},{name:"metalness",type:"Percentage",order:11986,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:"",locale:{zh:"metalness",en:"metalness"}},{name:"color",locale:{en:"color",zh:"颜色"},type:"Color",desc:{zh:"设置当前物体的原始颜色。",en:"Sets the color of the component."},order:8615,groupName:"bg",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"transparent",locale:{en:"transparentTexture",zh:"贴图可透明"},type:"Boolean",desc:{zh:"是否使用带透明区域的图片作为贴图，通过开关切换，默认为关闭。",en:"Defines whether allow the transparent part of the texture to be transparent. When disabled, the transparent part of the texture will be in white color."},order:9999,groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"opacity",locale:{en:"opacity",zh:"不透明度"},type:"Percentage",desc:{zh:"当前组件的不透明度，默认为100，即完全可视。可用滑块或调整数值进行调节。值越小组件越透明，为零时即完全不可见。\n在事件面板设置时需填入小数，范围为0~1。",en:"Sets the opacity of the component using a percentage value."},order:8617,groupName:"opacity0",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"link",locale:{en:"textureURL",zh:"皮肤贴图"},type:"Upload",desc:{zh:"上传图片作为当前物体的贴图。",en:"Uploads the texture of the component. The image URL is automatically generated when uploading an image file from local folder. Supported formats are jpg, jpeg, png and gif."},order:8616,groupName:"skin",ctrlHide:0,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"anisotropy",type:"Integer",locale:{zh:"纹素清晰度",en:"anisotropy"},desc:{zh:"沿着轴，通过具有最高纹素密度的像素的样本数。 默认情况下，这个值为1。设置一个较高的值将会产生比基本的mipmap更清晰的效果，代价是需要使用更多纹理样本。 取值范围1-8",en:"Sets the number of samples taken along the axis through the pixel that has the highest density of texels. By default, this value is 1. A higher value gives a less blurry result than a basic mipmap, at the cost of more texture samples being used. This value is usually a power of 2, ranging from 1 to 8 in VXLab."},order:10552,groupName:"skin",showDes:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"minFilter",type:"Select",options:[{name:"LinearFilter",en:"LinearFilter",zh:"线性过滤"},{name:"NearestFilter",en:"NearestFilter",zh:"NearestFilter"},{name:"LinearMipmapLinearFilter",en:"LinearMipmapLinearFilter",zh:"LinearMipmapLinearFilter"}],locale:{zh:"纹素覆盖类型",en:"minFilter"},desc:{zh:"当一个纹素覆盖小于一个像素时，贴图将如何采样。如果选择LinearMipmapLinearFilter， 它将使用mipmapping以及三次线性滤镜，图片的宽高像素值有要求的，为2的幂次方。",en:"Sets how the texture is sampled when a texel covers less than one pixel."},order:10264,groupName:"material",ctrlHide:1,linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"specular",locale:{en:"specularColor",zh:"反光颜色"},type:"Color",desc:{zh:"设置当前物体的反光颜色。",en:"Sets the color of the specular of the component."},order:8614,groupName:"material",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"shininess",locale:{en:"specularLevel",zh:"反光度"},type:"Number",desc:{zh:"设置当前物体的反光度。",en:"Sets the degree of specular of the component. The bigger the value, the shinier the surface."},order:8613,groupName:"material",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"bgLink",locale:{en:"backgoundImage",zh:"法线贴图"},type:"Upload",desc:{zh:"上传一个黑白灰的图，以标记物体表面的凹凸效果。图的部分越黑，渲染之后该部分越突出。",en:"Sets the background image of the component. The image URL is automatically generated when uploading an image file from local folder. Supported formats are jpg, jpeg, png and gif."},order:8618,groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"alphaMap",type:"Upload",locale:{zh:"透明贴图",en:"alphaMap"},desc:{zh:"alphaMap：是一张灰度纹理，用于控制整个表面的不透明度。（黑色：完全透明；白色：完全不透明）。",en:"alphaMap"},order:11038,showDes:1,groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"specularMap",type:"Upload",locale:{zh:"高光贴图",en:"specularMap"},desc:{zh:"specularMap：设置高光贴图来实现部分区域反光。贴图中颜色的值越高（从黑到白），贴图中越白的部分，反光越强烈，相反黑的部分，则不反光。",en:"specularMap"},order:11039,showDes:1,groupName:"material",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"emissive",type:"Color",locale:{zh:"发光颜色",en:"emissive"},desc:{zh:"emissive：基本上是不受其他光照影响的固有颜色。默认为黑色。",en:"emissive"},order:11040,showDes:1,groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"emissiveIntensity",type:"Number",locale:{zh:"发光强度",en:"emissiveIntensity"},desc:{zh:"emissiveIntensity：放射光强度。调节发光颜色的强度。默认为1。",en:"emissiveIntensity"},order:11041,showDes:1,groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"emissiveMap",type:"Upload",locale:{zh:"发光贴图",en:"emissiveMap"},desc:{zh:"emissiveMap：设置发光（放射）贴图。默认值为null。发光贴图颜色由发光(放射)颜色和强度所调节。 如果你有一个发光(放射)贴图，请务必将放射颜色设置为黑色以外的其他颜色。\n",en:"emissiveMap"},order:11042,showDes:1,groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"lightMap",type:"Upload",locale:{zh:"光照贴图",en:"lightMap"},desc:{zh:"lightMap：模拟灯光的贴图，是把物体相互的影响明暗信息保存到贴图上面，直白的说就是模拟灯光照射，代替真实灯光照射。",en:"lightMap"},order:11043,showDes:1,groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"aoMap",type:"Upload",order:12026,locale:{zh:"AO贴图",en:"aoMap"},groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"normalMap",type:"Upload",order:12027,locale:{zh:"法线贴图",en:"normalMap"},groupName:"skin",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"roughnessMap",type:"Upload",order:12028,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:"",locale:{zh:"roughnessMap",en:"roughnessMap"}},{name:"metalnessMap",type:"Upload",order:12029,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:"",locale:{zh:"metalnessMap",en:"metalnessMap"}},{name:"overlapDepth",type:"Number",locale:{zh:"重叠判断层数",en:"overlapDepth"},desc:{zh:"\n当前对象能够触发重叠事件时，拖动的对象与当前对象的父子关系最大层级差；0为对象本身，1为其父对象，以此类推。\n只有重叠判断层数高于其与移动对象之间父子层级差，当前对象与其他对象的重叠事件才能正确触发。重叠判断层数越高，运行时的性能消耗也越高。",en:"Sets the depth of the current object inside its moving parent when dictating its overlap trigger. When an object moves with its parent objects and overlaps with another object, its Overlap Depth needs to be no less than 1 such that its overlap trigger can occur. Similarly, a value no less than 2 needs to be set for Overlap Depth in the case that it moves with its grandparent. "},showDes:1,order:10400,groupName:"behaviorBase",linkZH:"",linkEN:""}],extends:["three-point","three-point-control"],methods:[{name:"show",desc:{zh:"组件从隐藏状态切换到显示状态。",en:"Shows the component and renders it as UI on the page. This is the same as setting Visible property to 'true'."},locale:{zh:"显示",en:"show"},order:8622,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"hide",desc:{zh:"组件从显示状态切换到隐藏状态。",en:"Hides the component and does not render it as UI on the page. This is the same as setting Visible property to 'false'."},locale:{zh:"隐藏",en:"hide"},order:8623,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"toggle",locale:{zh:"交替显示",en:"toggleVisible"},desc:{zh:"当前组件为显示状态时，会切换为隐藏状态；反之，则切换为显示状态。",en:"Shows or hides the component alternately."},order:8624,groupName:"default",linkZH:"",linkEN:""},{name:"tweenTo",params:[{name:"duration",type:"Formula",locale:{zh:"变换时长",en:"duration(s)"},desc:{zh:"变换状态动画持续的时长",en:"The number of seconds that the transition animate will take."}},{name:"easing",type:"Select",options:[{name:"linear",en:"linear",zh:"linear"},{name:"swing",en:"swing",zh:"swing"},{name:"easeInQuad",en:"easeInQuad",zh:"easeInQuad"},{name:"easeOutQuad",en:"easeOutQuad",zh:"easeOutQuad"},{name:"easeInOutQuad",en:"easeInOutQuad",zh:"easeInOutQuad"},{name:"easeInCubic",en:"easeInCubic",zh:"easeInCubic"},{name:"easeOutCubic",en:"easeOutCubic",zh:"easeOutCubic"},{name:"easeInOutCubic",en:"easeInOutCubic",zh:"easeInOutCubic"},{name:"easeInQuart",en:"easeInQuart",zh:"