数据ID降序排列"，表示方法如下[{"column":"数据ID","order":"desc"}]，升序则是order值为asc',paramNameZH:"排序方法"},{paramName:"range",paramDesZH:'"起始位置"从0开始；需要输出的行数，从1开始。比如，要输出最开始的10条数据，则"起始位置"填0，"输出行数"填10。如果不填输出行数，则默认为50条。注意，一次性输出过多的数据，会消耗数据库的性能，造成后台计算时间延长。建议每次输出，仅输出当前需要的数据，如果用户在前端需要查看一个很长的数据列表，则请使用分页的方法，分批次输出。',paramNameZH:"输出行数"},{paramName:"cols",paramDesZH:'选择数据库要输出的列，可以直接勾选，或者使用自定义方法，输入或绑定一个数组，比如 ["用户ID","姓名","得分"]。',paramNameZH:"输出列"},{paramName:"extra",paramDesZH:"",paramNameZH:""}]},en:{desEN:"Selects entries from the data table that satisfy specific conditions. The result can be re-ordered by sorting the value of specific fields, and be partially returned in Callback by setting Range parameter.",nameEN:"select(fromTheMasterCluster)",paramEN:[{paramName:"cons",paramDesEN:'You can set filter conditions by selecting the criteria for each field. For high-frequency and large data volume queries, ensure that indexes are added. Click the gear icon to switch to custom conditions, which must be in array format. For example, ["and", ["name", "eq", "Tom"]] represents filtering data where the name equals Tom, with "and" representing "and" and "eq" as the operator, where the left side of the operator is the field name and the right side is the specific value. Nested arrays can be used to implement multi-level complex filter conditions, such as ["and", ["or", ["name", "eq", "Tom"], ["_id", "eq", 1]], ["age", "gt", 1]]. In this structure, operators include: equal to with eq, not equal to with neq, contains with contains, does not contain with notContains, starts with startsWith, ends with endsWith, within range with in, not within range with nin, greater than with gt, less than with lt, greater than or equal to with gte, and less than or equal to with lte. When checking for date equality, two operators are needed: use gte for greater than or equal to the current date, and lt for less than the next day. For date inequality, use lt for less than the current date or gte for greater than or equal to th